+Fix the ``activate`` script running commands embedded in the environment name, ``--prompt`` or ``VIRTUALENV_PROMPT``
+when sourced by zsh with ``PROMPT_SUBST`` enabled, and escape ``%`` so zsh does not treat it as a prompt sequence.
